<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-K JULY NET UP TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-K JULY NET UP TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.04 vs   0.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.50 vs   1.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.25 vs   0.88</p>
<p> Sales		   12.08 vs  14.06</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.47 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.83 vs   4.20</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.42 vs   2.29</p>
<p> Sales		   90.72 vs  81.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Krakow SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
